## Summary
The article reports on a policy change in Korea increasing the acquisition tax reduction for youth housing from 2 million won to 3 million won, and extending this benefit to officetels.

## Key Points
- The acquisition tax reduction for youth housing has been raised from 2 million won to 3 million won.
- The policy now includes officetels in the eligibility for tax reduction.
- This update is likely aimed at making housing more accessible for young people in South Korea.


